{60}{Well, people used to frequent the tavern in the evenings. But since Death Lanterns began appearing in the village streets after nightfall, no one dares come here anymore. I understand why... They say those monsters are drawn to the Tomb of Tol Guldur. They seem to want to get inside...}{Well, people used to frequent the tavern in the evenings. But since Death Lanterns began appearing in the village streets after nightfall, no one dares come here anymore. I understand why... They say those monsters are drawn to the Tomb of Tol Guldur. They seem to want to get inside...}{}{}{}{gf3216 1}
{61}{Please tell me about the island.}{}{5}{lf1 1, lf3 0}{90}{lf3 1}
{62}{You tell @pcname@ about island?}{}{-4}{lf1 1, lf3 0}{90}{lf3 1}
{63}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{90}{The island is an ancient elven land. Its name, Tol Guldur, is said to mean 'the sorcerer's island' in their language... The village, moreover, is built above an ancient tomb, probably excavated by those elves. Our ancestors who first settled the island discovered within the tomb the secret ritual that allows a dead person's soul to leave the body in peace... We have guarded that secret from generation to generation ever since.}{The island is an ancient elven land. Its name, Tol Guldur, is said to mean 'the sorcerer's island' in their language... The village, moreover, is built above an ancient tomb, probably excavated by those elves. Our ancestors who first settled the island discovered within the tomb the secret ritual that allows a dead person's soul to leave the body in peace... We have guarded that secret from generation to generation ever since.}{}{}{}{}
